<view class="page-shell entry-page">
  <view class="hero-shell">
    <text class="hero-kicker">Copper Pot Dining</text>
    <text class="hero-title">铜锅涮肉</text>
    <text class="hero-subtitle">扫码落座，现点现涮。桌台识别后即可直接下单。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="paper-card entry-card">
    <view class="section-title">
      <text>开始点餐</text>
      <text>{{loading ? '识别桌台中' : '扫码 / 手输桌号'}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="table-banner">
      <text class="table-banner-label">当前桌台</text>
      <view wx:if="{{tableInfo}}" class="table-banner-main">
        <text class="table-banner-name">{{tableInfo.name}}</text>
        <text class="table-banner-area">{{tableInfo.area || '堂食区域'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:else class="table-banner-empty">
        <text>还没有识别到桌台。</text>
        <text>可直接输入桌号进行调试和点餐。</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">桌号</text>
      <input
        class="copper-input"
        type="number"
        placeholder="例如 8"
        value="{{tableId}}"
        bindinput="handleTableIdInput"
        bindblur="handleTableBlur"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">手机号（可选）</text>
      <input
        class="copper-input"
        type="number"
        maxlength="11"
        placeholder="绑定后可查看积分和消费记录"
        value="{{phone}}"
        bindinput="handlePhoneInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="entry-tips">
      <text>1. 未填写手机号也可以直接点餐。</text>
      <text>2. 会员页和积分明细需要手机号才能读取。</text>
      <text>3. 真机调试时请将接口地址换成局域网 IP。</text>
    </view>

    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="handleSubmit">
      进入点餐
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
